Third-party components bundled into dist/index.html
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Lit                     BSD-3-Clause    https://lit.dev
@lit/context            BSD-3-Clause    https://lit.dev
@lit-labs/virtualizer   BSD-3-Clause    https://lit.dev
uPlot                   MIT             https://github.com/leeoniya/uPlot
PapaParse               MIT             https://www.papaparse.com
Archivo                 OFL-1.1         https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Archivo

The single-file build inlines these dependencies. Their licences require the
notices above to travel with the distributed artifact. Archivo is on that list
for the same reason as the rest: the typeface is embedded in the HTML as a
data URI, so a copy of the font ships inside every artifact this repo produces.
The OFL requires its own text to travel with the font; it is vendored beside the
woff2 files at src/styles/fonts/OFL.txt.
